DESCRIPTION >
    Hash of the leaf-segment aggregates last sent to Postgres, per member and per organization,
    with the leaf's parent and grandparent at that time. The daily sinks compare the v2 aggregates
    with it to find leaf keys that are new, changed, gone or moved, and recompute only the parent and
    grandparent keys above them (linuxfoundation/lfx-cdp-insights-ops#1146).

SCHEMA >
    `kind` LowCardinality(String),
    `segmentId` String,
    `entityId` String,
    `parentId` String,
    `grandparentId` String,
    `hash` UInt64,
    `updatedAt` DateTime

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY kind, segmentId, entityId
